 "metadata_modified": "2026-06-26T17:16:22.524540",
 "name": "population-projections",
 "notes": "Annual population projections, from 2025 to 2051.\r\n\r\nThese datasets include population projections by age and gender organized by geography:\r\n\r\n* Projections for Ontario\r\n* Projections for each of the 6 regions\r\n* Projections for each of the 49 census divisions\r\n* Projections for each of the 34 public health units\r\n* Projections for each of the 9 Ministry of Children, Community and Social Services’ Service Delivery Division (SDD) regions\r\n\r\nFor Ontario only, the projected annual components of demographic change are provided for the reference, low- and high-growth scenarios. For all other geographies, only the reference scenario is produced.",
 "notes_translated": {
  "en": "Annual population projections, from 2025 to 2051.\r\n\r\nThese datasets include population projections by age and gender organized by geography:\r\n\r\n* Projections for Ontario\r\n* Projections for each of the 6 regions\r\n* Projections for each of the 49 census divisions\r\n* Projections for each of the 34 public health units\r\n* Projections for each of the 9 Ministry of Children, Community and Social Services’ Service Delivery Division (SDD) regions\r\n\r\nFor Ontario only, the projected annual components of demographic change are provided for the reference, low- and high-growth scenarios. For all other geographies, only the reference scenario is produced.",
  "fr": "Projections démographiques annuelles de 2025 à 2051.\r\n\r\nCes ensembles de données comprennent des projections démographiques selon l’âge et le genre organisées par géographie:\r\n\r\n* Projections pour l’Ontario\r\n* Projections pour les 6 régions\r\n* Projections pour les 49 divisions de recensement\r\n* Projections pour les 34 bureaux de santé\r\n* Projections pour les 9 régions de la Division de la prestation des services du ministère des Services à l'enfance et des Services sociaux et communautaires\r\n\r\nPour l'Ontario uniquement, les composantes annuelles projetées du changement démographique sont fournies pour les scénarios de référence, de croissance faible et de croissance forte. Pour toutes les autres géographies, seul le scénario de référence est produit."
 },
